  "mechanism": [
    "zlog_handle_work acquires zlog_lifetime_lock before scanning clients and retains it through zlog_write_internal and zlog_reset_client.",
    "zlog_unregister_client acquires the same lifetime mutex before taking client_lock and freeing client state.",
    "Record and notification paths use client_lock and reject a client with zero capacity, a NULL buffer or registered=false.",
    "Notify scheduling occurs before client_lock is released, closing the cancel-versus-late-queue race.",
    "The report worker is not canceled, so queued work for other clients remains queued."
  ],
